@title A 220 character tag wraps over several lines beside its triangle in the Issues list (1366x768)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# Regression from T0b: Issues rows ran off the edge. Fixture qa/fixtures/cabinet-long-tag.novo has a 220 character device tag, so its rows wrap to three or more lines.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-long-tag.novo
wait 20
click_text "warnings" Button
wait 10
shot issues-very-long-row
check_layout
